  ],
  "origin": "submission",
  "novelty": "unknown",
  "date": "2026-11-08",
  "references": [
   "https://github.com/MarinAndreGirard/qubit-stabilizer-codes-2026"
  ],
  "notes": "Code round2-001 of the release https://github.com/MarinAndreGirard/qubit-stabilizer-codes-2026 (codes/stabilizers/n053_k030_d06.txt). d >= 6 was proved by an exhaustive meet-in-the-middle search over all Paulis of weight <= 2 and all of weight 3 with a visit count equal to the closed form; see verify/ in the release. At its (n, k) the codetables.de lower bound on 4 November 2026 was below 6. No stabilizer-board entry has these (n, k); no equivalence is expected."
